an><span class=\"block text-xl font-black text-slate-900 leading-none mt-0.5\">20</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 items-center\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center bg-blue-50 text-blue-700 text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider border border-blue-100\">UAE What&#x27;s On: Events, Public Holidays &amp; Festivals 2026</span></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/60 mb-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl text-blue-600 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calendar w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M16 2v4\"></path><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M3 10h18\"></path></svg></div><div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Date &amp; Time</h2><p class=\"text-gray-900 font-semibold leading-tight\">Friday, 20 March 2026</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1\">Starts at <!-- -->10:30 PM</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white p-2.5 rounded-xl text-red-500 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Location</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 leading-snug\">Dubai, AE</p></div></div></div><article class=\"prose prose-lg prose-headings:text-slate-900 prose-p:text-slate-700 prose-a:text-blue-600 prose-a:font-semibold prose-img:rounded-xl max-w-none\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-xl font-medium text-slate-800 leading-relaxed border-l-4 border-blue-500 pl-6 py-1\"><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Planning an Eid holiday in the UAE? From luxury city escapes to serene beach retreats and mountain adventures, discover the best places to visit in the UAE during Eid holidays 2026 for families, couples, and travellers of all budgets.</p></div><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Eid holidays in the UAE are the perfect opportunity to unwind, explore, and reconnect with family. Whether you’re planning a <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">luxury staycation</strong>, a <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">beachside escape</strong>, a <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">cultural retreat</strong>, or an <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">adventure-filled break</strong>, the UAE offers unforgettable experiences across all seven emirates.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">If you’re wondering <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">where to travel during Eid holidays in the UAE</strong>, this updated <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">2026 guide</strong> highlights the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">best places to visit for Eid</strong>, helping you plan a memorable getaway with minimal travel and maximum enjoyment.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">Top Places to Visit in the UAE for Eid Holidays 2026</h2><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Dubai – Luxury, Entertainment &amp; Family Fun</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Dubai remains the most popular Eid holiday destination in the UAE, offering a world-class mix of entertainment, culture, shopping, and luxury resorts.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Dubai during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Relax at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Jumeirah Beach</strong> or <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">La Mer</strong></li><li>Book a luxury staycation at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Atlantis The Palm</strong> or <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Burj Al Arab</strong></li><li>Enjoy family attractions at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Dubai Parks &amp; Resorts</strong></li><li>Explore heritage sites in <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Fahidi Historical District</strong></li><li>Visit the iconic <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Museum of the Future</strong></li><li>Shop and dine at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Dubai Mall</strong> with seasonal Eid festivities</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Dubai for Eid?</strong><br/>Dubai offers something for every traveller — families, couples, solo visitors, and luxury seekers — making it a top Eid holiday choice year after year.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Abu Dhabi – Culture, Luxury &amp; Island Escapes</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Abu Dhabi is ideal for travellers who want a balanced Eid break combining <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">culture, relaxation, and theme-park thrills</strong>.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Abu Dhabi during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Visit the stunning <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Sheikh Zayed Grand Mosque</strong></li><li>Spend a fun-filled day at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Ferrari World</strong> or <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Warner Bros. World</strong></li><li>Unwind on the white sands of <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Saadiyat Island</strong></li><li>Explore world-class art at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Louvre Abu Dhabi</strong></li><li>Try <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">mangrove kayaking</strong> for a peaceful nature experience</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Abu Dhabi for Eid?</strong><br/>Perfect for travellers seeking cultural depth, family attractions, and premium resorts in one destination.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Ras Al Khaimah – Adventure &amp; Nature Escape</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Ras Al Khaimah is a favourite Eid getaway for adventure lovers and those looking to escape city crowds.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Ras Al Khaimah during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Experience the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Jebel Jais Zipline</strong>, the world’s longest</li><li>Camp or enjoy heritage experiences at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Bedouin-style desert camps</strong></li><li>Relax at beachfront resorts on <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Marjan Island</strong></li><li>Visit <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Dhayah Fort</strong> for panoramic mountain views</li><li>Go on a desert safari with traditional Emirati hospitality</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Ras Al Khaimah for Eid?</strong><br/>Ideal for adventure seekers, couples, and nature lovers looking for a refreshing Eid break.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Fujairah – Beach &amp; Nature Retreat</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Located on the UAE’s east coast, Fujairah is perfect for travellers seeking calm beaches and scenic landscapes during Eid.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Fujairah during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Snorkel or scuba dive at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Snoopy Island</strong></li><li>Stay at beachfront resorts in <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Aqah</strong></li><li>Explore <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Fujairah Fort</strong>, one of the UAE’s oldest forts</li><li>Visit <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Badiyah Mosque</strong>, the oldest mosque in the UAE</li><li>Enjoy boat rides and coastal views in <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Dibba</strong></li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Fujairah for Eid?</strong><br/>A peaceful destination ideal for couples, families, and anyone looking to slow down during the holidays.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Al Ain – Heritage, Nature &amp; Family Experiences</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Known as the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Garden City</strong>, Al Ain offers a refreshing blend of history, greenery, and family-friendly attractions.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Al Ain during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Walk through the UNESCO-listed <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Ain Oasis</strong></li><li>Visit <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Jahili Fort</strong> and <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Ain Palace Museum</strong></li><li>Drive or hike up <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Jebel Hafeet</strong> for breathtaking views</li><li>Relax at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Green Mubazzarah</strong></li><li>Spend time with family at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Ain Zoo</strong></li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Al Ain for Eid?</strong><br/>Perfect for travellers interested in heritage, nature, and relaxed family outings.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Sharjah – Culture &amp; Family-Friendly Attractions</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Sharjah is the cultural heart of the UAE, making it an excellent Eid destination for educational and meaningful travel.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Sharjah during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Explore the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Sharjah Museum of Islamic Civilization</strong></li><li>Walk through the historic <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Heart of Sharjah</strong></li><li>Visit <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Noor Island</strong> for nature and art</li><li>Enjoy waterfront views at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Majaz Waterfront</strong></li><li>Shop for traditional items at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Souq Al Jubail</strong></li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Sharjah for Eid?</strong><br/>A quieter, culturally rich destination ideal for families and culture enthusiasts.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h3 class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-800\">Ajman – Quiet Beachside Getaway</h3><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Ajman is perfect for those seeking a relaxed, crowd-free Eid holiday.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Top things to do in Ajman during Eid:</strong></p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Unwind at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Ajman Beach</strong></li><li>Stay at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Ajman Saray Luxury Resort</strong></li><li>Visit <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Ajman Museum</strong> to learn about local history</li><li>Kayak through mangroves at <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Al Zorah Nature Reserve</strong></li><li>Enjoy fresh seafood at beachside restaurants</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\"><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Why visit Ajman for Eid?</strong><br/>Ideal for couples and families looking for a peaceful and affordable Eid escape.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">How to Choose the Best Eid Holiday Destination in the UAE</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">When planning your Eid holidays, consider:</p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li>Travel time and crowd levels</li><li>Family-friendly vs adventure-focused activities</li><li>Budget for staycations and experiences</li><li>Availability of Eid events and attractions</li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Early planning helps secure better hotel deals and stress-free travel.</p><hr class=\"w-full my-6 border-t border-gray-200\"/><h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-gray-900 border-b border-gray-100 pb-3\">Final Thoughts: Where Will You Travel This Eid?</h2><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">From luxury city escapes to tranquil beaches and mountain adventures, the UAE offers some of the <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">best Eid holiday destinations</strong> in the region. No matter your travel style, Eid holidays are the perfect time to explore the country and create lasting memories.</p><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">For more inspiration, explore:</p><ul class=\"list-disc ml-6 space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-700 marker:text-primary text-lg\"><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Free Eid Events &amp; Festive Activities in the UAE</strong></li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">UAE Eid Holidays: Dates, Events &amp; Travel Tips</strong></li><li><strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">Best Eid Travel Destinations for UAE Residents</strong></li></ul><p class=\"mb-6 leading-relaxed text-gray-900 text-base\">Follow <strong class=\"font-extrabold text-gray-800\">TopTenUAE.com</strong> for the latest UAE holiday guides, travel inspiration, and event updates.</p></article></di